<div class="toplang">
<p><span>Línguas Disponíveis: </span><a href="./en/new_features_2_4.html" hreflang="en" rel="alternate" title="English">&nbsp;en&nbsp;</a> |
<a href="./es/new_features_2_4.html" hreflang="es" rel="alternate" title="Español">&nbsp;es&nbsp;</a> |
